          <div class="mnist-grid-label">Flattened vector, 784 coordinates</div>
          <canvas id="mnistVector" width="600" height="170"></canvas>
          <div class="mnist-info">
            <span class="dim">Each bar = one pixel's intensity.</span><br>
            Dimension: <span class="hi">784</span> &nbsp;•&nbsp; Lit pixels: <span class="hi" id="mnistLit">–</span> &nbsp;•&nbsp; Norm ‖x‖: <span class="hi" id="mnistNorm">–</span>
